title: albeni_topic_character_monologue_test_1
tags:
---
Albeni: I swear, if somebody steals my lighter again...
Albeni: I’m lighting them up myself.
===

title: albeni_topic_character_monologue_test_2
tags:
---
Albeni: Y’know what’s crazy? 
Albeni: How people just throw away half-decent shoes. 
Albeni: Like, that’s gold to us.
===

title: albeni_topic_character_monologue_test_3
tags:
---
Albeni: Every time I hear the trains at night...
Albeni: I start thinkin’ about just hoppin’ one. 
Albeni: See where it takes me.
===

title: albeni_topic_character_monologue_test_4
tags:
---
Albeni: Can’t lie, I kinda like the smell of motor oil. 
Albeni: Reminds me of when we first started runnin’ jobs.
===

title: albeni_topic_character_monologue_test_5
tags:
---
Albeni: Somebody better stop leavin’ crumbs all over the couch. 
Albeni: Ants don’t pay rent here.
===

title: albeni_topic_character_monologue_test_6
tags:
---
Albeni: Sometimes I sit back and think, man… how did we even make it this far? 
Albeni: Guess we tougher than we look.
===
